  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "This component serves as the specialized data ingestion service for COLLADA (.dae) files, transforming raw XML into structured ModelData. It handles the complex parsing of 3D asset components, including scene graph traversal, geometry definition, material properties, and animation data. Key logic involves indexing XML elements, deduplicating geometry vertices, and converting matrix data from row-major to gl-matrix compatible formats."
  },
